📊 CI/CD GITHUB ACTIONS
├─ URL: https://github.com/E-Code-AI/e-code/actions
├─ Trigger: Automatic on push/PR to main
├─ Jobs: 7 (Quality, Tests, Build, Deploy, Monitoring)
└─ Time: ~10-15 minutes

📈 PROMETHEUS METRICS
├─ Port: 9464
├─ Endpoint: /metrics
├─ Local: http://localhost:9464/metrics
├─ Replit: https://votre-app.replit.app/metrics
└─ Grafana: Node.js Dashboard ID: 11159

📝 WINSTON LOGS
├─ Location: logs/application.log, logs/error.log
├─ View: tail -f logs/application.log
├─ Format: JSON with correlation IDs
├─ Rotation: 20MB max, 14 days retention
└─ Levels: error, warn, info, debug

🏥 HEALTH CHECKS
├─ /health - Global status
├─ /health/liveness - K8s liveness probe (Replit uses this)
├─ /health/readiness - K8s readiness probe (Replit uses this)
└─ /health/detailed - Full diagnostics (DB, Memory, Disk, Metrics)

📚 SWAGGER API DOCS
├─ Endpoint: /api/docs
├─ Local: http://localhost:5000/api/docs
├─ Replit: https://votre-app.replit.app/api/docs
├─ Features: Try it out, Auth, Schemas, Examples
└─ Export: /api/docs/json (OpenAPI spec)

🧪 TESTS
├─ npm run test:ci - Fast CI tests (30s)
├─ npm run test:unit - Unit tests (2-3min)
├─ npm run test:integration - Integration tests (3-5min)
├─ npm run test:e2e - E2E Playwright (5-7min)
├─ npm run test:load - Load tests Artillery (3-5min)
├─ npm run test:coverage - Coverage report (HTML)
└─ npm run test:full - All tests (15-20min)

🔍 OPENTELEMETRY TRACING
├─ Port: 9464 (with Prometheus)
├─ Protocol: OTLP/HTTP
├─ Jaeger UI: docker run jaegertracing/all-in-one
├─ Access: http://localhost:16686
└─ Features: Distributed traces, Timeline, Bottlenecks

🛡️ CIRCUIT BREAKERS
├─ Status: curl /health/detailed | jq '.circuitBreakers'
├─ States: CLOSED (ok), OPEN (failed), HALF_OPEN (testing)
├─ Config: 5 failures → OPEN, retry after 30s
└─ Protection: Auto-fallback on service failure

